    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/extras/4cd880e5ed15ac13e5b7fb2f5eba3f31.avif?t=1755564062\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no escape. No guidance. Just the wind through dead branches\u2026 and something moving in the fog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everstill Valley</strong> is a slow-burning survival horror experience set in a decaying, dreamlike wilderness. Scavenge what you can. Manage your hunger, thirst, and sanity. And always keep an eye on the trees. <strong>Something is out there</strong>, and it doesn\u2019t stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/extras/fc23b2ca17bb9ad61cd8b74224e0be02.poster.avif?t=1755564062\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/extras/fc23b2ca17bb9ad61cd8b74224e0be02.webm?t=1755564062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/extras/fc23b2ca17bb9ad61cd8b74224e0be02.mp4?t=1755564062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>unsettling locations</strong> that feel misplaced: a phone booth deep in the forest. A metro tunnel that goes nowhere. A mountain-sized husk kneeling to the sky. Nothing makes sense here, and the longer you stay the harder it becomes to trust your own thoughts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/extras/9eb223ff78f7554d6fba19a6c9cb65d2.webp?t=1755564062\" width=616 height=60 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and endure</strong> a surreal, open-ended forest wilderness</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/extras/4845cfe0b7c7bdd447e16f8bcd9c0742.poster.avif?t=1755564062\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/extras/4845cfe0b7c7bdd447e16f8bcd9c0742.webm?t=1755564062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/extras/4845cfe0b7c7bdd447e16f8bcd9c0742.mp4?t=1755564062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage survival needs</strong>: hunger, health, and sanity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forage by day</strong>, <strong>fear the night</strong>: where something stalks you slowly, always visible, never stopping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover forgotten structures</strong>: abandoned homes, strange ruins, and impossible architecture</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/extras/720b60ac43a7a457ceb6ca14842d6f79.poster.avif?t=1755564062\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/extras/720b60ac43a7a457ceb6ca14842d6f79.webm?t=1755564062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/extras/720b60ac43a7a457ceb6ca14842d6f79.mp4?t=1755564062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day/night cycle</strong> with dynamic fog, lighting, and events tied to time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist UI &amp; lo-fi visuals</strong> evoke PSX-era horror, letting atmosphere take the lead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No combat</strong>. Just you, the dark, and your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How long can you survive when even your mind begins to break?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/extras/4cd880e5ed15ac13e5b7fb2f5eba3f31.avif?t=1755564062\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no escape. No guidance. Just the wind through dead branches\u2026 and something moving in the fog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everstill Valley</strong> is a slow-burning survival horror experience set in a decaying, dreamlike wilderness. Scavenge what you can. Manage your hunger, thirst, and sanity. And always keep an eye on the trees. <strong>Something is out there</strong>, and it doesn\u2019t stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/extras/fc23b2ca17bb9ad61cd8b74224e0be02.poster.avif?t=1755564062\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/extras/fc23b2ca17bb9ad61cd8b74224e0be02.webm?t=1755564062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/extras/fc23b2ca17bb9ad61cd8b74224e0be02.mp4?t=1755564062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>unsettling locations</strong> that feel misplaced: a phone booth deep in the forest. A metro tunnel that goes nowhere. A mountain-sized husk kneeling to the sky. Nothing makes sense here, and the longer you stay the harder it becomes to trust your own thoughts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/extras/9eb223ff78f7554d6fba19a6c9cb65d2.webp?t=1755564062\" widt