</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day/night cycle</strong> with dynamic fog, lighting, and events tied to time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist UI &amp; lo-fi visuals</strong> evoke PSX-era horror, letting atmosphere take the lead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No combat</strong>. Just you, the dark, and your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How long can you survive when even your mind begins to break?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
